{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i><strong>Rogum A Cat Match Puzzle</strong></i></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>is a unique puzzle adventure that blends relaxing match mechanics with thrilling challenges. Help a resourceful cat survive a strange dream world by matching colorful blocks, avoiding enemies and escaping the ever-rising water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Getting started is easy. Use your mouse to move the cat and click on the blocks to reveal them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/e8f5b0ad47e2cb0376c184f5f4b5a198.poster.avif?t=1759473271\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/e8f5b0ad47e2cb0376c184f5f4b5a198.webm?t=1759473271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you progress through fantasy islands, each puzzle becomes more complex, introducing tricky obstacles, powerful abilities, and even epic boss encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i><strong>Sharp memory</strong></i></u>, quick thinking and clever moves will be your keys to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/59c423dacaa73fcffd80c43df3f9f6a5.poster.avif?t=1759473271\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/59c423dacaa73fcffd80c43df3f9f6a5.webm?t=1759473271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Along the way, collect <u><i><strong>coins</strong></i></u> to customize your cat with <u><i><strong>charming skins</strong></i></u> and <u><i><strong>glowing auras</strong></i></u>, making the journey truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/6c01f4154edecc616a81af2002357b5d.poster.avif?t=1759473271\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/6c01f4154edecc616a81af2002357b5d.webm?t=1759473271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Coins can be used to buy also <u><i><strong>power-ups</strong></i></u> that will help you stay ahead of the game when pressure gets too intense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/e8fee2baa1a6a30bf85aca6bc496db71.poster.avif?t=1759473271\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/e8fee2baa1a6a30bf85aca6bc496db71.webm?t=1759473271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Match-2 mechanic with a twist:</strong></i></u><strong> </strong>train your memory, focus, and agility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Customize your cat:</strong></i></u><strong> \u00a0</strong>unlock skins and auras in the shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>50 handcrafted levels:</strong></i></u><strong> </strong>puzzles grow tougher as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Rising water mechanic:</strong></i></u><strong> \u00a0</strong>forces you to stay sharp under real-time pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Powerful abilities:</strong></i></u><strong> </strong>stop water, reveal hidden blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Epic boss battles &amp; tricky enemies:</strong></i></u><strong> \u00a0</strong>add an extra layer of difficulty</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Inspired by a Real Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>This game was inspired by my real cat, Petra, who survived an accident. Here she is during recovery. Her fight to get better inspired Rogum's journey through a dream world of challenges and hope</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/d840c5a2a73af23b01dbf0ca5b438b8d.avif?t=1759473271\" data-has-big width=1560 height=2080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">Do you have what it takes to save the cat? Solve every puzzle, think under pressure, and at the end uncover the touching <u><i><strong>story of the game.</strong></i></u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3992100?t=1759473271","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/b7036ee94a60dbc213aa0d0a40865ec4786cef02/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759473271","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/adc2acb4d9910a8fa06ad568516337268f44aa5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759473271","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/adc2acb4d9910a8fa06ad568516337268f44aa5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759473271","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i><strong>Rogum A Cat Match Puzzle</strong></i></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>is a unique puzzle adventure that blends relaxing match mechanics with thrilling challenges. Help a resourceful cat survive a strange dream world by matching colorful blocks, avoiding enemies and escaping the ever-rising water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Getting started is easy. Use your mouse to move the cat and click on the blocks to reveal them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/e8f5b0ad47e2cb0376c184f5f4b5a198.poster.avif?t=1759473271\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/e8f5b0ad47e2cb0376c184f5f4b5a198.webm?t=1759473271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you progress through fantasy islands, each puzzle becomes more complex, introducing tricky obstacles, powerful abilities, and even epic boss encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i><strong>Sharp memory</strong></i></u>, quick thinking and clever moves will be your keys to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/59c423dacaa73fcffd80c43df3f9f6a5.poster.avif?t=1759473271\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/59c423dacaa73fcffd80c43df3f9f6a5.webm?t=1759473271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Along the way, collect <u><i><strong>coins</strong></i></u> to customize your cat with <u><i><strong>charming skins</strong></i></u> and <u><i><strong>glowing auras</strong></i></u>, making the journey truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/6c01f4154edecc616a81af2002357b5d.poster.avif?t=1759473271\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/6c01f4154edecc616a81af2002357b5d.webm?t=1759473271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Coins can be used to buy also <u><i><strong>power-ups</strong></i></u> that will help you stay ahead of the game when pressure gets too intense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/e8fee2baa1a6a30bf85aca6bc496db71.poster.avif?t=1759473271\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/e8fee2baa1a6a30bf85aca6bc496db71.webm?t=1759473271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Match-2 mechanic with a twist:</strong></i></u><strong> </strong>train your memory, focus, and agility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Customize your cat:</strong></i></u><strong> \u00a0</strong>unlock skins and auras in the shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>50 handcrafted levels:</strong></i></u><strong> </strong>puzzles grow tougher as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Rising water mechanic:</strong></i></u><strong> \u00a0</strong>forces you to stay sharp under real-time pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Powerful abilities:</strong></i></u><strong> </strong>stop water, reveal hidden blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Epic boss battles &amp; tricky enemies:</strong></i></u><strong> \u00a0</strong>add an extra layer of difficulty</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Inspired by a Real Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>This game was inspired by my real cat, Petra, who survived an accident. Here she is during recovery. Her fight to get better inspired Rogum's journey through a dream world of challenges and hope</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/extras/d840c5a2a73af23b01dbf0ca5b438b8d.avif?t=1759473271\" data-has-big width=1560 height=2080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">Do you have what it takes to save the cat? Solve every puzzle, think under pressure, and at the end uncover the touching <u><i><strong>story of the game.</strong></i></u></p>","developers":["DevGamesRo"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992100/cd177f862336f527289fcbd3bc4c6a266007fc68/header.jpg?t=1759473271","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3992100/228928997/8fdf017234b25eb77cb34f0c5bec0912e28a3d20/1759391418/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759393760","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3992100/228928997/8fdf017234b25eb77cb34f0c5bec0912e28a3d20/1759391418/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759393760","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3992100/228928997/8fdf017234b25eb77cb34f0c5bec0912e28a3d20/1759391418/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759393760","id":257193938,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193938/movie480.mp4?t=1759393760","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193938/movie_max.mp4?t=1759393760"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257193938/5305f00f52ef231ad2bf126efdde5c318db0ea38/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759393760","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193938/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1759393760","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193938/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1759393760"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3992100/1324467511/cf97c72724cb905819a3f90d0837b2b98442d92d/1757162519/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759392807","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3992100/1324467511/cf97c72724cb905819a3f90d0837b2b98442d92d/1757162519/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759392807","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3992100/1324467511/cf97c72724cb905819a3f90d0837b2b98442d92d/175